employer_name_bieselgov = Federal Republic of Biesel
employer_description_bieselgov = The Federal Republic of Biesel is an independent state and considered the economic and social centre of the Orion Spur. They employ a myriad of diplomats and workers, often seen onboard NanoTrasen vessels to ensure good relations with the company, and uphold Tau Ceti law.

employer_name_solgov = Solarian Alliance Department of State
employer_description_solgov = The ASSN is a federal union of 70 member state star systems, and 198 dependencies. They employ a myriad of aligned officers and diplomats abroad to advocate for the alliance and its people.

employer_name_prca = People's Republic of Adhomai
employer_description_prca = the PRC is the hadiist government of Adhomai, they send diplomats abroad to ensure the fair treatment of tajarans, uphold party values, and act as a hand to the People's Republic.

employer_name_goldendeep = The Midas Group
employer_description_goldendeep = a collective of powerful merchants from the Golden Deep, when not busy in a managing the Great Game, their agents can be found abroad fostering trade deals and relations, and ensuring their citizens remain profitable.

employer_name_elyragov = Serene Republic of Elyra Foreign Affairs Ministry
employer_description_elyragov = The diplomatic sector of the Elyran Republic's government, often sent abroad to ensure the fair treatment of their citizens, represent the government, and learn about other cultures.
